    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "PROVENANCE & LIMITS",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 42,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### What is represented\nSource timestamps are interpreted as UTC and displayed in Europe/Berlin. PV, SoC, power, events and transactions come from the SOFIE historical replay (December 2025\u2013June 2026). Reported wallbox power is summed without imputing missing minutes. Connector state is event-based and can be stale. Inverter flow, other loads, weather, tariff, forecast and live actuation are unavailable."
      }
